hw/audio/es1370: estimate the DMA frame position between audio callbacks

The frame counter only advanced in the audio backend callback, so a polling guest saw steps of one audio period.
The position is now estimated from the time since the last transfer, bounded by what that transfer moved.
Measured with Quake III: polls without progress fell from 61.8 % to 2.7 %, with no audible difference. QEMU_ES1370_POSITION_ESTIMATE=0 turns the estimate off.

Apply after qemu92x-es1370-subword-access.patch: patch -p0 -i ../fixes/qemu92x-es1370-dma-position.patch

